* R-peak detector
Vthresh rpeak_threshold 0 0.33
Xrpeak ecg_amp_l0 rpeak_threshold rpeak_pulse vdd vss vbias rpeak_detector

* Delay timer
Vth14 vth_14 0 0.4757
Vth69 vth_69 0 0.4471
Vth83 vth_83 0 0.4684
Vth300 vth_300 0 0.3269
Vth10 vth_10 0 0.2282
Xdelay rpeak_pulse trig_s14 trig_s69 trig_wid trig_bi_copy trig_rr_copy vdd vss vbias vth_14 vth_69 vth_83 vth_300 vth_10 delay_timer
.ic v(xdelay.timer_node) = 0.9
.ic v(xdelay.timer2) = 0.9

* RR timing (F1, F2)
Xrr ecg_amp_l0 trig_rr_cap rpeak_pulse trig_rr_copy f1_rr_ratio f2_rr_asym rr_timer_node rr_ewma_node vdd vss vbias rr_timing
.ic v(xrr.net_timer) = 0.9
.ic v(xrr.ewma_node) = 0.15
.ic v(xrr.prev_node) = 0.15

* P-wave predictor
Vthpb vth_pw_base 0 0.157
Vthpp vth_pw_peak 0 0.118
Xpw rr_timer_node rr_ewma_node trig_pw_base trig_pw_peak trig_rr_cap vth_pw_base vth_pw_peak vdd vss vbias pwave_predictor

* F3: Beat instability L0
Xbi_l0 ecg_amp_l0 rpeak_pulse trig_bi_copy f3_bi_l0 vdd vss vbias beat_instability

* F4: Beat instability L1
Xbi_l1 ecg_amp_l1 rpeak_pulse trig_bi_copy f4_bi_l1 vdd vss vbias beat_instability

* F5: P-wave diff
Xpwave ecg_amp_l0 trig_pw_base trig_pw_peak f5_pwave vdd vss vbias pwave_diff

* F6: QRS width
